.TH FORGEKIT-ANALYZE 1 "2026-08-25" "ForgeKit 0.3.4" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
forgekit-analyze \- Analyze the project structure and practices
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B forgekit analyze
[\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Analyze a ForgeKit project across multiple categories: architecture, tests,
security, configuration, Docker, and documentation. Provides category scores
(0-100), a global score, and recommendations for improvement.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-ci
CI/CD mode: non-interactive, deterministic, exit codes 0/1/2, no spinners
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show help
.SH GLOBAL OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-debug
Enable debug output
.TP
.B \-\-format \fIformat\fR
Output format: human, json (default: human)
.TP
.B \-\-quiet
Reduce output (except errors and JSON)
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Analyze current project:
.B forgekit analyze
.TP
Analyze in CI mode:
.B forgekit analyze --ci
.TP
Analyze with JSON output:
.B forgekit analyze --format json
.SH CATEGORIES
.TP
.B Architecture
Hexagonal structure, dependency direction, separation of concerns
.TP
.B Tests
Test coverage, table-driven tests, test organization
.TP
.B Security
Dependencies, secrets, input validation, authentication
.TP
.B Configuration
Environment variables, .env files, config structure
.TP
.B Docker
Dockerfile, docker-compose, multi-stage builds
.TP
.B Documentation
README, API docs, code comments
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success (global score >= 70 or not in CI mode)
.TP
.B 1
Issues detected (global score < 70 in CI mode)
.TP
.B 2
Execution error
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ./forge.yaml
Project configuration
.TP
.I ./.forge/features.yaml
Installed features
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR forgekit (1),
.BR forgekit-doctor (1),
.BR forgekit-check (1)
.SH AUTHOR
ForgeKit Contributors <forgekit@demetrius-ch.github.io>